{%- comment -%}
  Shipping & Returns Page Template
  Generic shipping policy for US, Canada, Mexico
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="min-h-screen bg-black py-12 sm:py-16 md:py-24">
  <div class="container px-4">
    <div class="text-center mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <h1 class="display-heading mb-4 sm:mb-6 text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-6xl">
        Shipping & Returns
      </h1>
      <p class="text-bekky-gray-light text-lg sm:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
        Everything you need to know about shipping, delivery, and returns.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-6">
      
      {%- comment -%} Shipping Information {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="neon-card">
        <h2 class="text-bekky-purple-neon text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-6 font-heading">Shipping Information</h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">Where We Ship</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed mb-4">
              We currently ship to the following locations:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mb-4 space-y-2 text-bekky-gray-light">
              <li>United States (all 50 states)</li>
              <li>Canada</li>
              <li>Mexico</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              International shipping beyond these regions is not available at this time. We apologize for any inconvenience.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">Processing Time</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              Orders are typically processed within 1-3 business days (Monday-Friday, excluding holidays). During peak seasons, sales, or high-volume periods, processing may take up to 5 business days. You will receive an email confirmation once your order ships.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">Shipping Methods & Delivery Times</h3>
            
            <div class="bg-bekky-purple-neon/10 border-l-4 border-bekky-gold-neon p-4 rounded-lg mb-4">
              <h4 class="text-bekky-gold-neon font-heading mb-2">United States</h4>
              <ul class="list-disc ml-6 space-y-1 text-bekky-gray-light text-sm">
                <li><strong>Standard Shipping:</strong> 5-7 business days</li>
                <li><strong>Express Shipping:</strong> 2-3 business days (if available)</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-bekky-purple-neon/10 border-l-4 border-bekky-gold-neon p-4 rounded-lg mb-4">
              <h4 class="text-bekky-gold-neon font-heading mb-2">Canada</h4>
              <ul class="list-disc ml-6 space-y-1 text-bekky-gray-light text-sm">
                <li><strong>Standard Shipping:</strong> 7-14 business days</li>
                <li>Customs and duties may apply (customer responsibility)</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-bekky-purple-neon/10 border-l-4 border-bekky-gold-neon p-4 rounded-lg mb-4">
              <h4 class="text-bekky-gold-neon font-heading mb-2">Mexico</h4>
              <ul class="list-disc ml-6 space-y-1 text-bekky-gray-light text-sm">
                <li><strong>Standard Shipping:</strong> 7-14 business days</li>
                <li>Customs and duties may apply (customer responsibility)</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed text-sm mt-4">
              <strong>Note:</strong> Delivery times are estimates and not guaranteed. Delays may occur due to weather, carrier issues, customs processing, or other factors beyond our control. We are not responsible for delays caused by shipping carriers.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">Shipping Costs</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Shipping costs are calculated at checkout based on:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mb-4 space-y-2 text-bekky-gray-light">
              <li>Destination address</li>
              <li>Package weight and dimensions</li>
              <li>Selected shipping method</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              Free shipping may be available for orders over a certain amount. Check our homepage or promotions for current offers.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">Order Tracking</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              Once your order ships, you'll receive an email with a tracking number. You can track your package using the carrier's website or by logging into your account. If you don't receive a tracking email within 5 business days, please contact us.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">Incorrect or Damaged Orders</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              If you receive the wrong item or a damaged product, contact us immediately at <a href="mailto:BigButtAssociation@gmail.com" class="neon-text-purple hover:text-bekky-gold-neon transition-colors">BigButtAssociation@gmail.com</a> with your order number and photos of the issue. We'll send a replacement or provide a full refund, including return shipping costs.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} Returns & Exchanges {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="neon-card">
        <h2 class="text-bekky-purple-neon text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-6 font-heading">Returns & Exchanges</h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">Return Policy</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed mb-4">
              We want you to love your purchase! If you're not completely satisfied, you may return eligible items within <strong>30 days</strong> of delivery for a refund or exchange.
            </p>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed mb-4">
              <strong>To be eligible for return, items must:</strong>
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mb-4 space-y-2 text-bekky-gray-light">
              <li>Be unworn, unwashed, and in original condition</li>
              <li>Have all original tags attached</li>
              <li>Be in original packaging (if applicable)</li>
              <li>Be returned within 30 days of delivery</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">Non-Returnable Items</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed mb-4">
              The following items are <strong>final sale</strong> and cannot be returned:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mb-4 space-y-2 text-bekky-gray-light">
              <li>Items marked as "Final Sale" or "Clearance"</li>
              <li>Items that have been worn, washed, or damaged</li>
              <li>Items without original tags</li>
              <li>Gift cards</li>
              <li>Custom or personalized items (unless defective)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">How to Return an Item</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed mb-4">
              To initiate a return:
            </p>
            <ol class="list-decimal ml-6 mb-4 space-y-2 text-bekky-gray-light">
              <li>Contact us at <a href="mailto:BigButtAssociation@gmail.com" class="neon-text-purple hover:text-bekky-gold-neon transition-colors">BigButtAssociation@gmail.com</a> with your order number and reason for return</li>
              <li>We'll provide you with a Return Merchandise Authorization (RMA) number and return instructions</li>
              <li>Package the item(s) securely in the original packaging (if available)</li>
              <li>Include the RMA number on the outside of the package</li>
              <li>Ship the return to the address provided (return shipping is the customer's responsibility unless the return is due to our error)</li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">Exchanges</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed mb-4">
              We offer exchanges for different sizes or colors, subject to availability. To exchange an item:
            </p>
            <ol class="list-decimal ml-6 mb-4 space-y-2 text-bekky-gray-light">
              <li>Follow the return process above</li>
              <li>Specify the size/color you'd like in your return request</li>
              <li>If the desired item is available, we'll ship it once we receive your return</li>
              <li>If the desired item is not available, we'll process a refund</li>
            </ol>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              <strong>Note:</strong> Exchanges are subject to product availability. If your desired size/color is out of stock, we'll process a refund instead.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">Refunds</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Once we receive and inspect your return, we'll process your refund within 5-10 business days. Refunds will be issued to the original payment method used for the purchase.
            </p>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed mb-4">
              <strong>Refund amounts:</strong>
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mb-4 space-y-2 text-bekky-gray-light">
              <li>Original product price will be refunded</li>
              <li>Original shipping costs are non-refundable (unless the return is due to our error or a defective product)</li>
              <li>Return shipping costs are the customer's responsibility (unless the return is due to our error)</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              You'll receive an email confirmation once your refund has been processed. Please allow additional time for your bank or credit card company to post the refund to your account.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">Defective or Damaged Items</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              If you receive a defective or damaged item, contact us immediately. We'll send a replacement at no cost to you, including free return shipping for the defective item. Please include photos of the defect or damage in your email.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} Contact {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="neon-card bg-bekky-purple-neon/10 border-2 border-bekky-purple-neon">
        <h2 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-4 font-heading text-center">Questions About Shipping or Returns?</h2>
        <p class="text-bekky-gray-light text-center leading-relaxed mb-6">
          We're here to help! If you have any questions about shipping, returns, or exchanges, don't hesitate to reach out.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center">
          <a href="mailto:BigButtAssociation@gmail.com" class="neon-button-purple neon-button-lg inline-block">
            Contact Us
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

